 75GE c  2007ScZX (also 2008Sc03): E=26 MeV beam provided by Yale tandem        
 75GE2c  accelerator. Enriched target. Particles detected with the Enge         
 75GE3c  spectrograph and gas-filled focal plane detector backed by a           
 75GE4c  scintillator. FWHM=70 keV. Measured cross sections (statistical        
 75GE5c  uncertainty 1%, systematic uncertainty 5%). Spectroscopic factors      
 75GE6c  deduced from analysis of cross section data by DWBA calculations       
 75GE7c  using PTOLEMY code                                                     
